 r←TestGetCacheHeaders url;Assert;New;_TestIfNoneMatch;cache_control;etag;h;mod_ddn;modified;old;res
⍝ Check GET QUERY endpoints return the correct headers related to the cache
⍝ No :Trap here: there is nothing to tear down, so an unexpected error reaches _Test,
⍝ which reports the failing statement.
 r←0
 Assert←##.Assert

 New←{
     h←#.HttpCommand.New'GET'⍵
     _←'origin'h.SetHeader url
     h
 }

⍝ Deep test on /videos
 h←New(url,'/videos')
 res←h.Run
 'Expected 200 OK from /videos'Assert 200=res.HttpStatus

 (etag modified cache_control)←res.GetHeader'ETag' 'Last-Modified' 'Cache-Control'
 'ETag header missing'Assert~0∊⍴etag
 'Last-Modified header missing'Assert~0∊⍴modified
 'Cache-Control header missing'Assert~0∊⍴cache_control
 mod_ddn←#.DCMS.DT.HTTPDate2DDN modified
 'Last-Modified is not a valid HTTP-date'Assert 1=≢mod_ddn

 h←New''
 'If-None-Match'h.SetHeader etag

 ⍝ Shallow test on other endpoints: each must call the shared helper
 _TestIfNoneMatch←{
⍝  ⍵: URL to request :: simple character vector
⍝ ⍺⍺: HttpCommand instance with 'If-None-Match' header set
⍝  ←: Success :: Boolean
     ⍺⍺.URL←⍵
     res←⍺⍺.Run
     r←304=res.HttpStatus
     r∧←0∊⍴res.Data
     r
 }

 'If-None-Match on /videos gave no empty 304'Assert h _TestIfNoneMatch(url,'/videos')
 'If-None-Match on /videos/{id} gave no empty 304'Assert h _TestIfNoneMatch(url,'/videos/',##.example_video)
 'If-None-Match on /videos/{id}/recommendations gave no empty 304'Assert h _TestIfNoneMatch(url,'/videos/',##.example_video,'/recommendations')
 'If-None-Match on /events gave no empty 304'Assert h _TestIfNoneMatch(url,'/events')
 'If-None-Match on /presenters gave no empty 304'Assert h _TestIfNoneMatch(url,'/presenters')

⍝ Invalid routes: a 304 stands in for a 200, never for an error
 h.URL←(url,'/videos/noexist1234')
 res←h.Run
 'Conditional GET for an unknown video must be 404, not 304'Assert 404=res.HttpStatus
 h.URL←(url,'/videos/short/recommendations')
 res←h.Run
 'Conditional GET with a malformed id must be 400, not 304'Assert 400=res.HttpStatus

 h←New(url,'/videos')
 'If-Modified-Since'h.SetHeader modified
 res←h.Run
 'If-Modified-Since with our own Last-Modified must be 304'Assert 304=res.HttpStatus
 'A 304 must have an empty body'Assert 0∊⍴res.Data

⍝ Get fresh data if modified since a month ago
 old←⊃'Ddd, DD Mmm YYYY hh:mm:ss "GMT"'#.DCMS.WP.FormatDateTime mod_ddn-30
 'If-Modified-Since'h.SetHeader old
 res←h.Run
 'If-Modified-Since a month ago must be 200'Assert 200=res.HttpStatus

 'If-Modified-Since'h.SetHeader'invalid-date'
 res←h.Run
 'A malformed If-Modified-Since must be 200'Assert 200=res.HttpStatus

⍝ Authenticated endpoints must never be stored by a shared cache
 h←'GET'##.MAIN.Authed(url,'/crud/event')
 res←h.Run
 'Expected 200 OK from /crud/event'Assert 200=res.HttpStatus
 'Authenticated responses must be no-store'Assert'no-store'≡res.GetHeader'Cache-Control'

 r←1
